    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43489",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Here a cry of hounds, and wind horns in a peal. Then enter Saturninus, Tamora, Bassianus, Lavinia, Chiron, Demetrius, and their Attendants.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 117,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43489/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 139,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5984848,
        "end": 5985047,
        "line": 222947,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@43489",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43692",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "Many good morrows to your majesty;\nMadam, to you as many and as good.\nI promised your grace a hunter’s peal.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43692/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 34,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43692/line-2",
          "start": 35,
          "end": 69,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43692/line-3",
          "start": 70,
          "end": 108,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5985051,
        "end": 5985194,
        "line": 222952,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@43692",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43839",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SATURNINUS.\nAnd you have rung it lustily, my lords;\nSomewhat too early for new-married ladies.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43839/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43839/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 51,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43839/line-3",
          "start": 52,
          "end": 94,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5985198,
        "end": 5985327,
        "line": 222958,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@43839",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SATURNINUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43972",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BASSIANUS.\nLavinia, how say you?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43972/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 10,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@43972/line-2",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 32,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5985331,
        "end": 5985393,
        "line": 222964,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@43972",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "BASSIANUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44038",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LAVINIA.\nI say no;\nI have been broad awake two hours and more.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44038/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44038/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 18,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44038/line-3",
          "start": 19,
          "end": 62,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5985397,
        "end": 5985494,
        "line": 222969,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@44038",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LAVINIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44139",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SATURNINUS.\nCome on then; horse and chariots let us have,\nAnd to our sport. [To Tamora.] Madam, now shall ye see\nOur Roman hunting.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 77,
          "end": 86
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44139/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44139/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44139/line-3",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 112,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44139/line-4",
          "start": 113,
          "end": 131,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5985498,
        "end": 5985676,
        "line": 222975,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@44139",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SATURNINUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44321",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARCUS.\nI have dogs, my lord,\nWill rouse the proudest panther in the chase,\nAnd climb the highest promontory top.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44321/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44321/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 29,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44321/line-3",
          "start": 30,
          "end": 75,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44321/line-4",
          "start": 76,
          "end": 113,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5985680,
        "end": 5985833,
        "line": 222982,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@44321",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARCUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44478",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "TITUS.\nAnd I have horse will follow where the game\nMakes way, and run like swallows o’er the plain.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44478/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44478/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44478/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5985837,
        "end": 5985971,
        "line": 222989,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap34/p@44478",
        "anchor": "sceneII_34.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "TITUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44616",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "DEMETRIUS.\nChiron, we hunt not, we, with horse nor hound,\nBut hope to pluck a dainty doe to ground.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "titus-andronicus/sceneII_34.2/p@44616/line-1",
          "start": 0,
